From: Fadjrir Herlambang <fadjrir.co.id@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 15:50:10 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(provider): add MiMo Free no-auth provider
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Add Xiaomi MiMo as a free tier provider with automatic JWT bootstrap:
- Custom executor handles bootstrap → JWT → chat flow
- JWT cached in-memory with 50-minute TTL, auto-retry on 401
- Supports reasoning_content (thinking) in SSE responses
- Models: mimo-auto, mimo-v2.5-pro, mimo-v2.5, mimo-v2-pro, mimo-v2-omni, mimo-v2-flash
